  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Although: indicative and subjunctive",
   "texto": [
    "With **anche se** + indicative you normally present the fact as real: **Anche se piove, esco**. With subjunctive it can be hypothetical: **Anche se piovesse, uscirei** (even if it rained, it would come out). **Sebbene** and **benché** usually go with subjunctive."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Nonostant and per quanto",
   "texto": [
    "**Nonostante** puede ir con nombre (**nonostante la pioggia**) o con **che** + subjuntivo (**nonostante piova**). **Per quanto** + subjunctive: **Per quanto studi, non passo** (however much I study, I do not approve)."
   ]
